<view class="page"><view class="kicker">SETTINGS / 我的</view><view class="title">让工具，按你的方式工作。</view><view class="subtitle">数据处理有边界，内容可追溯，也可带走。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="reload" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{profile}}"><view class="card"><text class="section-title">{{profile.user.display_name}}的私有空间</text><view class="field"><text class="label">工作空间名称</text><input class="input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="80"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">默认时区</text><input class="input" value="{{timezone}}" data-field="timezone" bindinput="input" placeholder="Asia/Shanghai"/><view class="hint">使用 IANA 时区名称。修改设置不会改写已有任务的时间。</view></view><button bindtap="saveSettings" disabled="{{busy}}">保存设置</button></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="section-title">外部 AI 与数据授权</text><view class="small">{{profile.ai.configured ? profile.ai.provider + ' / ' + profile.ai.model : '未配置外部 AI，本地规则仍可用'}}</view><view class="notice">{{profile.ai.disclosure}}</view><view class="row"><text class="setting-label">启用外部 AI</text><switch checked="{{profile.workspace.ai_enabled}}" bindchange="ai" disabled="{{busy || !profile.ai.configured}}" color="#637f4d"/></view><view class="hint">今日 {{profile.ai.usage.requests}} / {{profile.ai.usage.limit}} 次。每次整理仍需主动选择外部模式。</view></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="section-title">导出与存储</text><view class="small">当前内容及版本：{{profile.storage.bytes}} 字节 / {{profile.storage.limit}} 字节</view><view class="notice">导出 Markdown、原文和校验清单，不含密码与会话。导出包 24 小时失效，不等同于完整系统备份。</view><view class="row"><text class="small">附带历史版本与操作记录</text><switch checked="{{includeHistory}}" bindchange="history" color="#637f4d"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="export" disabled="{{busy}}">生成并下载导出包</button><button wx:if="{{canShare &amp;&amp; exportFile}}" bindtap="share" disabled="{{busy}}">选择发送到微信</button><view wx:if="{{exportFile &amp;&amp; !canShare}}" class="hint">此基础库没有文件转发能力，可从网页工作台下载导出包。</view></view>
    <view class="card"><text class="section-title">索引与服务</text><view class="small">从 Markdown 重建查询索引，不改写原始文件。损坏文件会单独报告。</view><button bindtap="reindex" disabled="{{busy}}">检查并重建索引</button><view class="hint">服务：{{apiBase}}</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{jobLabel}}" class="notice">{{jobLabel}}<text wx:if="{{report}}" class="mono">{{report}}</text></view>
    <view class="section row"><text class="section-title">{{archive ? '已归档' : '回收站'}}</text><label class="small"><switch checked="{{archive}}" bindchange="archive" color="#637f4d"/>查看归档</label></view><view class="hint">当前 MVP 支持恢复，不提供永久删除或自动留存清理。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><text class="file-title">{{item.title}}</text><view class="small">任务组 · {{item.tasks.length}} 项任务</view><button bindtap="restoreGroup" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复任务组</button></view>
    <view wx:for="{{captures}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><text class="record-text">{{item.integrity_error ? '原文损坏或不可用，文件未被改写。' : item.raw_text}}</text><view class="small">原始记录</view><view wx:if="{{item.integrity_error}}" class="hint danger-text">{{item.integrity_error.message}}</view><button bindtap="restoreCapture" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.integrity_error ? '恢复记录（原文仍不可用）' : '恢复原文'}}</button><button wx:if="{{archive &amp;&amp; item.integrity_error}}" bindtap="trashUnavailable" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">移入回收站</button></view><view wx:if="{{!groups.length &amp;&amp; !captures.length}}" class="notice">这里没有内容。</view>
    <view class="section"><text class="section-title">最近的后台任务</text><view wx:for="{{jobs}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view class="row"><text>{{item.kind_label}}</text><text class="badge">{{item.status === 'succeeded' ? '已完成' : item.status === 'failed' ? '失败' : item.status === 'running' ? '处理中' : '排队中'}}</text></view><view class="small">{{item.time_label}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.error}}" class="hint danger-text">{{item.error.message}}</view><button wx:if="{{item.kind === 'export' &amp;&amp; item.status === 'succeeded'}}" bindtap="download" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">下载导出包</button><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'running' || item.status === 'pending'}}" bindtap="checkJob" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看进度</button></view></view>
    <view class="divider"/><view class="hint">退出后清除当前页面数据，待上传草稿仅在此账号下保留。</view><button bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button>
  </view><view class="footer">归刻 · LOCAL MVP / 0.1</view>
</view>
